<title>GERMANY: Telekom bankers not to seek to affect share trade.</title>
<headline>Telekom bankers not to seek to affect share trade.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Telekom AG's bankers have made no arrangements to influence the share price of the newly-floated issue in its first days on the bourse, an official for one of its consortium banks said on Sunday.</p>
<p>&quot;Naturally we shall try to avoid wild-west tactics,&quot; Hansgeorg Hofmann, board member of Dresdner Bank said in response to a journalist question, adding that no arrangements had been made by Telekom's banking syndicate.</p>
<p>Deutsche Telekom had earlier held a news briefing to give details of its flotation due on Monday.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
